    "causal_summary": "A renamed packet kept the children of its old identity in graph metadata because the writer only unioned, and track roots were never validated. A refresh now prunes foreign-identity children, a registry rule reports any that remain, and a sweep reports declared-versus-actual child counts for every track root.",
